      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef subsets(items):\n    result, path = [], []\n\n    def backtrack(start):\n        result.append(path[:])\n        for i in range(start, len(items)):\n            path.append(items[i])\n            backtrack(i + 1)\n            path.pop()\n\n    backtrack(0)\n    return result\n\n\nfor subset in subsets([1, 2, 3]):\n    print(subset)\nprint(len(subsets(list(range(10)))))\n```",
